# Per-OS agent config + per-identity Host overlays (config.d entries are
# either lnk-managed per-OS or pulled from 1Password via installers/all).
Include ~/.ssh/config.d/*

### global settings

ForwardX11 no
ForwardX11Trusted no
TCPKeepAlive yes

### github

Host github.com
User git
Hostname ssh.github.com
Port 443

### dispatch — fast reuse across many ssh calls (auto-multiplexing)

Host germputer
ControlMaster auto
ControlPath ~/.ssh/cm-%r@%h:%p
ControlPersist 10m
ServerAliveInterval 30
ServerAliveCountMax 6
ForwardAgent yes

